# Personal financial data — never commit plaintext. Only the encrypted
# store (data/transactions.csv.enc) is meant to be tracked; see
# scripts/encrypt_store.py and README.md. Raw bank exports (xlsx/xls) belong
# outside this repo entirely (see README), but ignore them repo-wide too as
# a safety net in case one ever lands here by accident.
data/*.csv
data/*.dec
*.xlsx
*.xls

# Manual review decisions (finance_tracker/reviews.py) — keyed by transaction
# hash, but the values hold your own notes and the original bank descriptions,
# so this is personal data. Unlike category_overrides.json (merchant keywords
# only), it is never meant to be committed.
data/review_decisions.json

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

.venv/
.DS_Store
.env
